        Stop guessing your net earnings. Our free interactive <strong>fee calculator</strong> and <strong>platform fee comparison</strong> engine reveals exact platform cuts across <strong>PayPal Goods & Services</strong>, <strong>Stripe</strong>, <strong>Fiverr</strong>, <strong>Etsy</strong>, Gumroad, Lemon Squeezy, Whop, and 14+ platforms down to the exact penny at your price point and sales volume.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA row -->
      <div
        class="reveal-on-scroll stagger-4"
        style="
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      "
      >
        <a
          href="#calculator"
